<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT  - Protection One.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT  - Protection One.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Montgomery Securities analyst Carl Reichardt said he resumed coverage of the residential alarm monitoring company, Protection One Inc, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>Reichardt's earnings estimates are for $1.38 per share in fiscal 1996 ending in September and $1.29 for fiscal 1997. His 12-month target price is $18, or about 34 percent above current levels.</p>
<p>Shares were trading at 13-/4, up 1/8 at nidday in stock exchange trading.</p>
